                                                                                
 Usage: opentide generate docs [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...                      
                                                                                
 Generate markdown documentation for detection objects                          
                                                                                
╭─ Options ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ --output            <str>  Write the pages here instead of the configured    │
│                            docs folder                                       │
│ --flavor            <str>  Markdown flavour: github, gitlab, azure_devops or │
│                            generic                                           │
│ --rules                    Only rule pages; combine with --threats,          │
│                            --objectives                                      │
│ --threats                  Only threat pages; combine with --rules,          │
│                            --objectives                                      │
│ --objectives               Only objective pages; combine with --rules,       │
│                            --threats                                         │
│ --changed                  Regenerate only the pages of objects git reports  │
│                            as changed                                        │
│ --help                     Show this message and exit.                       │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯
╭─ Commands ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ rules       Generate rule documentation                                      │
│ objectives  Generate objective documentation                                 │
│ threats     Generate threat documentation                                    │
│ index       Generate the documentation index pages                           │
╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯

 Examples
   $ opentide generate docs
   $ opentide generate docs --changed
